{"type": "user", "message": {"role": "user", "content": [{"tool_use_id": "chatcmpl-tool-9b6ada1ee1151847", "type": "tool_result", "content": "# EMORL-TTS: Reinforcement Learning for Fine-Grained Emotion Control in LLM-based TTS\narXiv: 2510.05758\nAuthors: Haoxun Li, Yu Liu, Yuqing Sun, Hanlei Shi, Leyuan Qu, Taihao Li\nYear: 2025 | Venue: \nTopic: tts_vc\nStatus: unread\n\nContributions:\n  1. We introduce VAD-based global prosody control into LLM-based TTS to achieve continuously controllable emotional intensity through supervised fine-tuning and reinforcement learning.\n  2. We design a local prosody control mechanism based on prosodic prominence to enable controllable emphasis positioning and enhance fine-grained emotional regulation.\n  3. We construct a unified fine-grained emotion control framework combining global and local prosody control that significantly outperforms existing methods in synthesis quality and emotional controllability.\n\nTags: TTS, TTS/架构-AR-LLM, TTS/控制-风格标签, TTS/功能-RL优化", "is_error": false}]}, "parent_tool_use_id": null, "session_id": "75998b50-ad84-4936-92e8-9fa48d4f60ec", "uuid": "a7bf6bce-bd94-4751-a66a-e24df265ac60", "timestamp": "2026-07-29T07:17:34.361Z", "tool_use_result": {"stdout": "# EMORL-TTS: Reinforcement Learning for Fine-Grained Emotion Control in LLM-based TTS\narXiv: 2510.05758\nAuthors: Haoxun Li, Yu Liu, Yuqing Sun, Hanlei Shi, Leyuan Qu, Taihao Li\nYear: 2025 | Venue: \nTopic: tts_vc\nStatus: unread\n\nContributions:\n  1. We introduce VAD-based global prosody control into LLM-based TTS to achieve continuously controllable emotional intensity through supervised fine-tuning and reinforcement learning.\n  2. We design a local prosody control mechanism based on prosodic prominence to enable controllable emphasis positioning and enhance fine-grained emotional regulation.\n  3. We construct a unified fine-grained emotion control framework combining global and local prosody control that significantly outperforms existing methods in synthesis quality and emotional controllability.\n\nTags: TTS, TTS/架构-AR-LLM, TTS/控制-风格标签, TTS/功能-RL优化", "stderr": "", "interrupted": false, "isImage": false, "noOutputExpected": false}}
